# F429 UAC microphone capture arm: the same host/class path as the detect
# profile, opened at 16 kHz mono 16-bit and run for 10 s.  The PCM ring and the
# packet buffers live in the core board's 32 MB FMC SDRAM (the DWC2 host's DMA
# reach into it was proven by the stm32f429-sdram case and the UVC frame pool),
# and the FreeRTOS heap with them.
#
# The image carries the UVC class and its descriptor census even though the
# window measures only the microphone: this camera's audio function produces
# samples only after the video function has been claimed (a microphone-only
# image receives zero-length packets; measured 2026-11-20).  The census does
# not open or stream the camera, so the 10 s window is still microphone-only.
#
# Cases: the audio census, the video descriptor census (the composite init),
# then the microphone window.  The streaming interface is left at its
# alternate setting after the window, matching the camera family's "do not
# leave the streaming setting" rule.
CONFIG_ARCH_ARM_V7M=y
CONFIG_BACKEND_FREERTOS=y
CONFIG_OPT_O2=y
CONFIG_PROFILE_BASE=y
CONFIG_BOARD_STM32F429_CHALLENGER=y
CONFIG_FREERTOS_HEAP_SIZE=1048576
CONFIG_BOARD_AUTO_RESET=n
CONFIG_F429_SDRAM=y
CONFIG_F429_HEAP_SDRAM=y
CONFIG_RUNNER_STACK_KB=24
CONFIG_UVC_TARGET_WIDTH=640
CONFIG_UVC_TARGET_HEIGHT=480
CONFIG_UVC_FRAME_BYTES=131072
CONFIG_UAC_TARGET_RATE=16000
CONFIG_CASES="uac_detect uvc_detect uac_mic"